1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:06,182
In nineteen fifty-five, four scientists asked for funding for an audacious plan.

2
00:00:06,332 --> 00:00:11,423
Two summer months, and ten people, to teach a machine how to think.

3
00:00:11,723 --> 00:00:13,905
They believed one summer was enough.

4
00:00:14,055 --> 00:00:18,855
Seventy years have passed. And the story is far from over.

5
00:00:19,255 --> 00:00:22,455
This is the story of artificial intelligence.
